{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":38,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":38,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67f3df4429d1fd72f80ef","chatId":"c61fe37e45aa48258924cf46482cfc25","sessionId":null,"userId":99892,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"说出来的东西，就不再只是压在自己心里了——它从“只有我知道的怕”变成了两个人之间的话，所以轻了一点。这大概是你的感受第一次被完整听见。那现在回头看，你觉得是什么让这份沉重松动了？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"说出来的东西，就不再只是压在自己心里了——它从“只有我知道的怕”变成了两个人之间的话，所以轻了一点。这大概是你的感受第一次被完整听见。那现在回头看，你觉得是什么让这份沉重松动了？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2450,"promptTokens":2564,"completionTokens":124,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:08:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":39,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707111980749594,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67f3df4429d1fd72f80ee","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794539325812,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:08:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67f3df4429d1fd72f80ee","chatId":"c61fe37e45aa48258924cf46482cfc25","sessionId":null,"userId":99892,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（想了想）会吧，虽然他人不在跟前，但那种感觉一直都在。不过……说出来之后，好像没那么沉了，有点奇怪。<第19轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":38,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707111980749594,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67f3df4429d1fd72f80ef","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794539325809,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:08:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67f38f4429d1fd72f80ed","chatId":"c61fe37e45aa48258924cf46482cfc25","sessionId":null,"userId":99892,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“不管做什么都会让他失望”——这句话里有一种很沉的认命感，好像结局早就写好了，你只是在等着它发生。这种无力不是懒，是累了太久。那个“他”现在在你心里，还会说话吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“不管做什么都会让他失望”——这句话里有一种很沉的认命感，好像结局早就写好了，你只是在等着它发生。这种无力不是懒，是累了太久。那个“他”现在在你心里，还会说话吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2375,"promptTokens":3276,"completionTokens":119,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:08:40"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":37,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009707932711278412,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67f38f4429d1fd72f80ec","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794539320994,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:08:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67f38f4429d1fd72f80ec","chatId":"c61fe37e45aa48258924cf46482cfc25","sessionId":null,"userId":99892,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（叹气）就是那种……很沮丧，又有点无力的感觉。好像不管我做什么，最后都会变成让他失望的那一个。<第18轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptConten